# .plan — Siddharth Fit Implementation Plan

## Phase 1: Foundation

### 1.1 Project Setup

- [x] Initialize Next.js with App Router, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS
- [x] Configure `tsconfig.json` (strict mode)
- [x] Configure ESLint
- [x] Set up path aliases (`@/components`, `@/content`, `@/lib`)
- [x] Configure Tailwind design tokens (colors, spacing, radius, shadows, typography)
- [x] Add Google Fonts (Inter / Geist / Manrope)

### 1.2 Content Layer

- [x] Define TypeScript types: `Plan`, `Achievement`, `Certificate`, `Testimonial`, `SocialLink`, `TrainerProfile`
- [x] Create `content/site.ts` (brand metadata, URLs, email)
- [x] Create `content/plans.ts` (placeholder plan data)
- [x] Create `content/achievements.ts` (placeholder achievements)
- [x] Create `content/certificates.ts` (placeholder certificates)
- [x] Create `content/testimonials.ts` (placeholder testimonials)
- [x] Create `content/social.ts` (placeholder social links)

### 1.3 Layout Shell

- [x] Create root layout with theme provider
- [x] Build navigation (desktop full nav, mobile compact)
- [x] Build footer (logo, description, nav, social, email, CTA, copyright)
- [x] Implement theme system (Light / Dark / System, persisted, no flash)

---

## Phase 2: Core Pages

### 2.1 Homepage

- [x] Hero section (eyebrow, headline, supporting text, CTAs, portrait placeholder)
- [x] Trust indicators
- [x] Siddharth introduction / About preview
- [x] Training philosophy
- [x] Services overview
- [x] Achievements preview
- [x] Certifications preview
- [x] Client testimonials carousel/grid
- [x] Plans overview
- [x] Custom coaching section
- [x] Contact CTA banner
- [x] Scroll-reveal animations (opacity + translate, reduced-motion safe)

### 2.2 About Page (`/about`)

- [x] Portrait placeholder
- [x] Biography
- [x] Coaching philosophy
- [x] Experience and specialties
- [x] Training approach categories

### 2.3 Achievements Page (`/achievements`)

- [x] Achievement cards (title, year, organization, category, description)
- [x] Filter by category if volume warrants it

### 2.4 Certificates (`/certificates` and `/certificates/[slug]`)

- [x] Certificate listing with cards
- [x] Individual certificate page (preview, details, issuer, verification link)
- [x] Optimized images via `next/image`

### 2.5 Testimonials (`/testimonials`)

- [x] Testimonial cards (name/anonymous, role, quote, date)
- [x] No fabricated reviews

### 2.6 Plans (`/plans` and `/plans/[slug]`)

- [x] Plan cards (name, description, starting price, period, features)
- [x] Individual plan detail page
- [x] CTA: "Discuss This Plan" (links to contact)
- [x] Non-transactional pricing presentation

### 2.7 Contact (`/contact`)

- [x] Contact form (Name, Email, Subject, Message)
- [x] `mailto:` submission (browser opens email client)
- [x] Fallback text if email app does not open
- [x] Direct display: email, Instagram, WhatsApp (if supplied)

### 2.8 Search (`/search`)

- [x] Client-side static index (pages, plans, achievements, certificates, testimonials)
- [x] `Ctrl+K` / `Cmd+K` trigger on desktop
- [x] Dedicated search button on mobile

---

## Phase 3: Polish

### 3.1 Visual Effects

- [x] Pointer parallax on hero (GPU-friendly, transform-based)
- [x] 3D tilt on selected cards (subtle, pointer-responsive)
- [x] All effects disabled under `prefers-reduced-motion`
- [x] CSS 3D decorative object (dumbbell / geometric shape)

### 3.2 Error Handling

- [x] Custom 404 page ("Looks like this set isn't here anymore")
- [x] Route-level `error.tsx`
- [x] Global `global-error.tsx`
- [x] Stale-build chunk-failure recovery with reload guard

### 3.3 SEO

- [x] Per-route metadata (title, description, canonical, OG, Twitter)
- [x] Structured data (Person, ProfessionalService)
- [x] `/sitemap.xml` generation
- [x] `/robots.txt`

### 3.4 Security

- [x] Security headers (CSP, X-Content-Type-Options, Referrer-Policy, Permissions-Policy)
- [x] No secrets in source
- [x] No stack traces in production UI

### 3.5 Accessibility Audit

- [x] Keyboard navigation on all interactive elements
- [x] Visible focus indicators
- [x] Semantic heading hierarchy (single `<h1>` per page)
- [x] ARIA attributes on decorative elements
- [x] Sufficient color contrast in both themes
- [x] Screen reader testing

### 3.6 Performance

- [x] `next/image` on all raster images
- [x] Responsive image sizes
- [x] Lazy loading (except hero)
- [x] Minimal client JavaScript
- [x] Lighthouse review

---

## Phase 4: Pre-Launch

### 4.1 Content Replacement

- [ ] Insert Siddharth's real profile, biography, photograph
- [ ] Insert real certificates and verification URLs
- [ ] Insert real achievements
- [ ] Insert real testimonials (with permission)
- [ ] Insert real social links and email
- [ ] Insert real plan names and general pricing
- [ ] Remove all `[PLACEHOLDER]` markers

### 4.2 Testing

- [x] Chrome, Firefox, Safari, Edge
- [x] Android Chrome, iOS Safari
- [x] Keyboard-only navigation
- [x] Reduced motion mode
- [x] Dark mode
- [x] Slow network
- [x] Invalid routes (404)
- [x] Chunk loading failure (stale build)
- [x] Long content (long testimonial, long plan name)
- [x] Very narrow (320px) and very wide (1920px) viewports

### 4.3 Deployment

- [ ] Configure production domain
- [ ] Environment variables in deployment config only
- [x] CI pipeline: typecheck, lint, build
- [ ] Deployment smoke test
- [ ] Final Lighthouse review
